    "text": "Hyattsville\nRim-rocking, big-bodied 7-foot class of 2026 center Marcis Ponder lands an Indiana scholarship offer\nBy Jeff Rabjohns,\n2 days agoHYATTSVILLE, MD — Rim-rocking, big-bodied 7-foot class of 2026 center Marcis Ponder of The Gillion Academy in Virginia has landed an Indiana scholarship offer. IU coach Darian DeVries and assistant Kenny Johnson watched him over the weekend here at the DMV Live. Peegs.com also watched him at the DMV...\n2",
